WARNING:DEVICE_ATTR_FUNCTIONS: Consider renaming function(s) 'show_slidebar_mode' to 'slidebar_mode_show' 'store_slidebar_mode' to 'slidebar_mode_store'
#331: FILE: drivers/input/misc/ideapad_slidebar.c:222:
